# Web (Next.js)

- Arabic RTL first for user-facing UI.
- Keep public and admin experiences clearly separated within the single Next.js app.
- Never put server secrets in client bundles (`NEXT_PUBLIC_*` must be intentional and non-secret).
- Authorization is not implemented only through hidden UI — enforce via API/server checks.
- Do not perform operational database writes that bypass NestJS.
